{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00218",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 4.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor, the receptionist said you'd see me now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.72,
      "end_seconds": 8.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Not at all, please sit. What's the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 8.9,
      "end_seconds": 13.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.09,
      "text": "Um, so... breathlessness when I lie flat. That's why I came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.87,
      "end_seconds": 18.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Is this recent, or has it been a while?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.79,
      "end_seconds": 21.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Ever since... since last weekend, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.43,
      "end_seconds": 32.19,
      "duration_seconds": 9.76,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse. Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.01,
      "end_seconds": 41.43,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "Yes, lying flat. That makes it worse. It settles a little with sitting up on pillows. Pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.53,
      "end_seconds": 45.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Have you been waking up at night short of breath?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.96,
      "end_seconds": 48.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.05,
      "end_seconds": 52.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Right, and how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.59,
      "end_seconds": 54.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.69,
      "end_seconds": 57.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "Have you had tiredness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.36,
      "end_seconds": 59.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Yes, since last Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.99,
      "end_seconds": 62.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.5,
      "end_seconds": 64.34,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.37,
      "end_seconds": 79.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Have you had any chest pain or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.34,
      "end_seconds": 83.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "No chest pain or fainting, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.5,
      "end_seconds": 86.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "Any calf pain or fever at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.1,
      "end_seconds": 92.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.95,
      "text": "Uh, I haven't had calf pain or fever, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.22,
      "end_seconds": 97.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "How about your heart, any problems like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.48,
      "end_seconds": 101.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.48,
      "end_seconds": 106.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.75,
      "end_seconds": 118.34,
      "duration_seconds": 10.59,
      "text": "Yes, um, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.2,
      "end_seconds": 123.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "So, do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.42,
      "end_seconds": 127.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "Yes, high blood pressure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.08,
      "end_seconds": 131.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Sorry, the computer needs a moment to load this."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.81,
      "end_seconds": 132.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.77,
      "text": "No rush."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.18,
      "end_seconds": 149.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting. Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.92,
      "end_seconds": 159.86,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "Yes, I had a knee arthroscopy, three years ago. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.34,
      "end_seconds": 164.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.71,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.48,
      "end_seconds": 166.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.18,
      "end_seconds": 172.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Do you have any known allergies at all? Just so I get the full picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.39,
      "end_seconds": 174.18,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "No allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.92,
      "end_seconds": 177.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "How's everything else at home otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.76,
      "end_seconds": 185.63,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Busy. Everyone's running in different directions at the moment, you know how it is."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.24,
      "end_seconds": 188.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.47,
      "end_seconds": 194.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "It's amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.62,
      "end_seconds": 197.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Is it okay if I type while we talk?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.08,
      "end_seconds": 201.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Yes, of course, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.61,
      "end_seconds": 207.29,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.71,
      "end_seconds": 211.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.18,
      "end_seconds": 216.09,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.39,
      "end_seconds": 217.09,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.98,
      "end_seconds": 220.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.29,
      "end_seconds": 233.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "There's pitting oedema up to the shins on both legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.19,
      "end_seconds": 254.94,
      "duration_seconds": 16.75,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.42,
      "end_seconds": 258.36,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.92,
      "end_seconds": 277.71,
      "duration_seconds": 17.79,
      "text": "Putting it all together, this looks most like fluid overload related to the heart. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had breathlessness when you lie flat, since last weekend, severe, and no calf pain or fainting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.44,
      "end_seconds": 280.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Exactly, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 281.27,
      "end_seconds": 284.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.97,
      "end_seconds": 289.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.12,
      "end_seconds": 294.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "We should do a chest X-ray for breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 294.98,
      "end_seconds": 298.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "I can book that for Tuesday at 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.41,
      "end_seconds": 303.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.93,
      "text": "I'm prescribing furosemide, 40 milligrams, every morning, until we review. That's for fluid overload."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.35,
      "end_seconds": 305.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.13,
      "end_seconds": 321.56,
      "duration_seconds": 15.43,
      "text": "Keep the salt and the fluids moderate, no more than about one and a half litres a day. Keep an eye out, and if the breathlessness gets worse or you can't lie down at all, call us the same day or go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 322.85,
      "end_seconds": 324.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Yes, I'll do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.67,
      "end_seconds": 329.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Please come and see me after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.16,
      "end_seconds": 333.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "Sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 334.4,
      "end_seconds": 340.43,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.41,
      "end_seconds": 348.95,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "So, I take the furosemide, 40 milligrams, every morning and come back after the results are back. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.29,
      "end_seconds": 354.48,
      "duration_seconds": 4.19,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 355.17,
      "end_seconds": 359.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "Okay, thank you. I'll get started on all of that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 360.75,
      "end_seconds": 361.45,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}